    "content" : "I 3D-printed some brackets tonight for holding some circuit boards and the power plug in place. I&#39;m modernizing a very old flip clock, but trying to use the original parts when I can. I think the only things left to do now are cut the wooden case down to size, fill in some unnecessary holes, and clean the whole thing up. If I stay motivated, I&#39;ll have it done this week. ",
